INDX                       W  2  N   VALUE  0                                   
INDX2                      W  2  N   VALUE  0                                   
INDX-MAX                   W  2  N   VALUE  12                                  
INDX2-MAX                  W  2  N   VALUE  5                                   
INDX-PER                   W  2  N   VALUE  0                                   
INDX-T1                    W  2  N   VALUE  0                                   
W-PER-NUV                  W  2  N   VALUE  0                                   
W-PER-FORRA                W  2  N   VALUE  0                                   
SW-NY-PERIOD               W  1  A   VALUE 'N'                                  
SW-NYTT-AR                 W  1  A   VALUE 'N'                                  
JA                         W  1  A   VALUE 'J'                                  
NEJ                        W  1  A   VALUE 'N'                                  
WDATKONV                   W  8  A   VALUE 'WDATKONV'                           
*                                                                               
WS-FLSEASON                W  1  A   VALUE ' '                                  
W-ANTAL-VECKOR             W  2  N   VALUE  0                                   
WS-KVOI-TOT-1              W  7  N   VALUE  0                                   
WS-KVOI-TOT-2              W  7  N   VALUE  0                                   
WS-KVOI-IAAR               W  7  N   VALUE  0                                   
WS-KVOI-INNEV              W  7  N   VALUE  0                                   
