TAB-TX-RAD          W  7 N OCCURS 12                                            
TX-KVOI-RP     TAB-TX-RAD           7 N                                         
*                                                                               
TAB-WEEKS           W 48  A                                                     
TAB-WEEKS-RAD       W 4 N OCCURS 12                                             
